#
#   title, "Press START" (START) -> first run only: "No Burnout saved game
#   present. Do you wish to create a new saved game?", cursor on Yes (A) ->
#   first run only: Enter Your Name, "PL1", cursor on END (A) -> main menu,
#   Championship (A) -> Vehicle Select, Supermini Easy (A) -> Transmission
#   Select, AT (A) -> Championship list, Journeyman Grand Prix (A) -> race
#   1/3, Supermini AT, Interstate (A: Confirm) -> the race intro flyover ->
#   the start line, lap 1/3, position 4/4.
#
# Every choice is the default row. The route presses A thirteen times, 7 s
# apart: that covers the two first-run screens and the race intro's
# "Continue (A)", which a nine-press train missed on replay. The spare
# presses land in the race intro, where A does nothing that changes the
# race.
#
# Player control: RT held for 4 s took the Supermini from 0 to 44 mph in
# second gear as the race timer ran (nav frames 008-a7 -> 009-rt). The
# play pattern holds RT and weaves the left stick.
#
wait 40.0
press START
wait 8.0
press A
wait 7.0
press A
wait 7.0
press A
wait 7.0
press A
wait 7.0
press A
wait 7.0
press A
wait 7.0
press A
wait 7.0
press A
wait 7.0
press A
wait 7.0
press A
wait 7.0
press A
wait 7.0
